    category: 'Professional · AI Project Management',
    title: 'Cordelia — AI Module',
    description:
      'Project manager for the AI module of Cordelia, a clinic patient-data platform. Scoped requirements directly with the founders and advocated an API-based LLM architecture over training a proprietary model, balancing speed, cost, and data sensitivity for a healthcare context.',
